  2024 VintageTasted: Apr 2025
  
  Dark ruby, opaque core, purple reflections, delicate edge brightening. Delicate cassis, black cherry, a hint of blackberry, pleasant wood savouriness, inviting bouquet. Juicy, fine red forest berries, a hint of currant, finesse-rich acid structure, ripe tannins, elegant and long-lasting, red berry touch, a delicate food companion.
  
  [About Falstaff](https://www.wine-searcher.com/critics-22-falstaff)
  
